          "content": {
            "id": "99f7b89d-c17f-3f1b-bd92-b81a121b249a",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Telefonica renewed one Huawei 5G contract in Spain until 2030, report says",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "MADRID (Reuters) -Telefonica renewed a contract with Chinese manufacturer Huawei to supply equipment for its 5G mobile core network for retail customers in Spain until 2030, El Pais newspaper reported on Thursday, citing unnamed industry sources.  Telefonica renewed that contract in late 2024 and, in early 2025, it awarded to rival manufacturer Nokia a contract for 5G core for its service to companies and government institutions, El Pais said.",
